{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1, and P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    if n <= 2:\n        return memo[n]\n\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        memo[i] = memo[memo[i-1]] + memo[i - memo[i-1]]\n\n    return memo[n]"}
