{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "```python\n_memo = {}\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Newman-Conway sequence number using memoization.\n    P(1)=1, P(2)=1, P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer\")\n\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        _memo[n] = 1\n        return 1\n\n    # Calculate P(n) = P(P(n - 1)) + P(n - P(n - 1))\n    val_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n\n    term1 = sequence(val_n_minus_1)\n    term2 = sequence(n - val_n_minus_1)\n\n    result = term1 + term2\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result\n```"}
