{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "```python\ndef _combinations(n, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\n    This helper computes \"n choose k\" efficiently.\n    \"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0 or k == n:\n        return 1\n    # Optimization: C(n, k) = C(n, n-k) to reduce iterations.\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(k):\n        # Using integer division since C(n, k) is always an integer.\n        res = res * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n    return res\n\ndef eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the Eulerian number a(n, m).\n    It computes the number of permutations of {1, ..., n} with exactly m ascents.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Handle the special case a(0,0) as defined in the design specification.\n    if n == 0 and m == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    # Validate inputs n and m according to the design specification.\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n    if not (0 <= m < n):\n        raise ValueError(\"m must be 0 <= m < n\")\n\n    # Calculate a(n, m) using the specified summation formula.\n    # a(n, m) = sum_{k=0}^{m} (-1)^k * C(n+1, k) * (m - k + 1)^n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(m + 1):\n        term = ((-1)**k) * _combinations(n + 1, k) * ((m - k + 1)**n)\n        total_sum += term\n\n    return total_sum\n```"}
