{"task_id": "Mbpp/145", "solution": "```python\ndef max_Abs_Diff(arr: tuple[int | float, ...]) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute difference between any two elements in a given array.\n    Returns 0 if the array has fewer than two elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(arr) < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    min_val = arr[0]\n    max_val = arr[0]\n\n    for x in arr:\n        if x < min_val:\n            min_val = x\n        if x > max_val:\n            max_val = x\n\n    return abs(max_val - min_val)\n```"}
