{"task_id": "Mbpp/166", "solution": "```python\ndef find_even_pair(integer_list: list[int]) -> int:\\\n    \"\"\"Counts pairs of integers in a list whose XOR operation results in an even number.\"\"\"\n    current_count = 0\n    n = len(integer_list)\n\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        num1 = integer_list[i]\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            num2 = integer_list[j]\n            # XOR result is even if both numbers have the same parity (both even or both odd).\n            if (num1 % 2) == (num2 % 2):\n                current_count += 1\n\n    return current_count\n```"}
