{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "```python\ndef _factorial(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the factorial of a non-negative integer.\n    Assumes num is a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    if num == 0:\n        return 1\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(1, num + 1):\n        res *= i\n    return res\n\ndef _binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\n    Assumes 0 <= k <= n.\"\"\"\n    num_n = _factorial(n)\n    num_k = _factorial(k)\n    num_n_minus_k = _factorial(n - k)\n    return num_n // (num_k * num_n_minus_k)\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of C(n, k) for even k (0 <= k <= n).\n    Assumes n is a positive integer.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return total_sum\n```"}
