{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "```python\ndef _kadane(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum sum of a contiguous subarray within a given array.\n    It applies Kadane's algorithm to efficiently compute this sum.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_max = 0\n    global_max = float('-inf')\n    for x in array:\n        current_max = max(x, current_max + x)\n        global_max = max(global_max, current_max)\n    return global_max\n\ndef _max_prefix_sum(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum sum of any prefix of the array.\n    It iterates through the array, accumulating sums and tracking the maximum.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_sum = 0\n    max_so_far = float('-inf')\n    for x in array:\n        current_sum += x\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_sum)\n    return max_so_far\n\ndef _max_suffix_sum(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum sum of any suffix of the array.\n    It iterates through the array in reverse, accumulating sums and tracking the maximum.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_sum = 0\n    max_so_far = float('-inf')\n    for x in reversed(array):\n        current_sum += x\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_sum)\n    return max_so_far\n\ndef max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in a modified array formed by repeating arr k times.\n    It uses Kadane's algorithm and prefix/suffix sums based on k and the array sum.\n    \"\"\"\n    if k == 1:\n        return _kadane(arr)\n    else:\n        arr_sum = sum(arr)\n        max_overall = _kadane(arr + arr) # Covers subarrays within 1 or 2 repetitions\n\n        if arr_sum > 0 and k > 2:\n            max_prefix = _max_prefix_sum(arr)\n            max_suffix = _max_suffix_sum(arr)\n            # Subarray spans first array (suffix), k-2 full arrays, last array (prefix)\n            max_overall = max(max_overall, max_prefix + arr_sum * (k - 2) + max_suffix)\n\n        return max_overall\n```"}
