{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "```python\ndef max_length(list_of_lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list of maximum length in a list of lists, returning its length and the list itself.\n    If multiple lists share the maximum length, the first one encountered is returned.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return (0, [])\n\n    max_len = 0\n    longest_list = []\n\n    for inner_list in list_of_lists:\n        current_len = len(inner_list)\n        if current_len > max_len:\n            max_len = current_len\n            longest_list = inner_list\n\n    return (max_len, longest_list)\n```"}
