{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "```python\ndef find_lucas(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the n'th Lucas number iteratively.\n    Uses base cases L(0)=2, L(1)=1, and L(n) = L(n-1) + L(n-2) for n > 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    else:\n        l0, l1 = 2, 1\n        for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n            l0, l1 = l1, l0 + l1\n        return l1\n```"}
