{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "```python\ndef cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\n    It uses a memoized helper function for efficiency.\"\"\"\n    _perrin_cache = {\n        0: 3,\n        1: 0,\n        2: 2\n    }\n\n    def _get_perrin_number(k: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Computes the k-th Perrin number, utilizing memoization.\"\"\"\n        if k in _perrin_cache:\n            return _perrin_cache[k]\n\n        result = _get_perrin_number(k - 2) + _get_perrin_number(k - 3)\n        _perrin_cache[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += _get_perrin_number(i)\n    return total_sum\n```"}
