{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given integer.\n    It iterates up to the square root of num to find factors efficiently.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of num (inclusive).\n    for i in range(1, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n        if num % i == 0:\n            factor1 = i\n            factor2 = num // i\n\n            if factor1 % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += factor1\n\n            # Check factor2 only if it's different from factor1 to avoid double-counting perfect square roots.\n            if factor2 != factor1 and factor2 % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += factor2\n\n    return total_sum\n```"}
