{"task_id": "Mbpp/739", "solution": "```python\ndef find_Index(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the smallest integer k such that T(k) has 'n' digits.\n    This means 10^(n-1) <= k * (k + 1) / 2 < 10^n.\n    \"\"\"\n    lower_bound = 10**(n - 1)\n    k = 1\n    while True:\n        triangular_k = k * (k + 1) // 2\n        if triangular_k >= lower_bound:\n            return k\n        k += 1\n```"}
