{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "```python\ndef find_min_diff(array, length):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the minimum absolute difference between any two distinct elements in an array.\n    Optimized by sorting the array and checking only adjacent elements.\"\"\"\n    if length < 2:\n        return float('inf')\n\n    # Sort the array to ensure minimum difference is between adjacent elements.\n    sorted_array = sorted(array)\n\n    min_diff = float('inf')\n\n    # Iterate through adjacent pairs to find the minimum difference.\n    for i in range(length - 1):\n        current_diff = abs(sorted_array[i+1] - sorted_array[i])\n        if current_diff < min_diff:\n            min_diff = current_diff\n\n    return min_diff\n```"}
