{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "```python\ndef left_rotate(n: int, d: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Performs a left bitwise rotation on `n` by `d` bits, treating `n` as a 32-bit unsigned integer.\n    The result is also a 32-bit unsigned integer.\"\"\"\n    d = d % 32  # Normalize d for 32-bit rotation; rotation by 32 is no change.\n\n    # Combine left-shifted bits with bits that wrapped around from the left.\n    # The final bitwise AND ensures the result is confined to 32 bits.\n    return ((n << d) | (n >> (32 - d))) & 0xFFFFFFFF\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/804", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List, Union\n\ndef is_product_even(numbers: List[Union[int, float]]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if the product of numbers in a list is even.\n    Returns True if any number in the list is even or zero, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    for num in numbers:\n        # If any number in the list is even (or zero), their product will inherently be even.\n        if num % 2 == 0:\n            return True\n    # If no even number or zero was found, all numbers must be odd, resulting in an odd product.\n    return False\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/805", "solution": "```python\ndef max_sum_list(list_of_lists: list[list[int]]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"This function finds and returns the inner list with the highest sum of elements.\n    It iterates through all inner lists, calculating their sums and tracking the maximum.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    highest_sum = float('-inf')\n    list_with_highest_sum = None\n\n    for inner_list in list_of_lists:\n        current_sum = sum(inner_list)\n        if current_sum > highest_sum:\n            highest_sum = current_sum\n            list_with_highest_sum = inner_list\n\n    return list_with_highest_sum\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/805", "solution": "```python\ndef max_sum_list(list_of_lists: list[list[int]]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the inner list from a list of lists whose sum of elements is the highest.\n    If the input list is empty, an empty list is returned.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return []\n\n    max_sum = float('-inf')\n    max_list = []\n\n    for inner_list in list_of_lists:\n        current_sum = sum(inner_list)\n        if current_sum > max_sum:\n            max_sum = current_sum\n            max_list = inner_list\n\n    return max_list\n```"}
