{"task_id": "Mbpp/806", "solution": "```python\ndef max_run_uppercase(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the maximum length of consecutive uppercase characters in a string.\n    Returns 0 if no uppercase characters are found.\"\"\"\n    current_run = 0\n    max_run = 0\n\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char.isupper():\n            current_run += 1\n        else:\n            max_run = max(max_run, current_run)\n            current_run = 0\n\n    # Final check to capture any uppercase run at the end of the string\n    max_run = max(max_run, current_run)\n\n    return max_run\n```"}
