{"task_id": "Mbpp/782", "solution": "```python\ndef odd_length_sum(arr: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd-length subarrays from a given array of integers.\n    Returns the total sum of all elements in all odd-length subarrays.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    total_sum = 0\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            subarray = arr[i : j + 1]\n            if len(subarray) % 2 != 0:\n                total_sum += sum(subarray)\n\n    return total_sum\n```"}
